  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forest Conservation Solomon Islands (A12954)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity will support the protection of forests and the ecosystem services they provide, through delivery of alternative source of revenue for landowners. Would initially involve pilot programmes with&#xa0;communities in the Babatana, East Rennell and Zaira/Lupu Vangunu areas of Solomon Islands.</narrative>
  </description>
